ccc60c.m4a", "recitedText": "يَشْكُرُونَ"}, {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hunna", "arabic": "يَشْكُرْنَ", "plain": "يَشْكُرْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/468c4f98cda958e4b94d.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "arabic": "ٱشْكُرْ", "plain": "اُشْكُرْ", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/94802a1549c461563edc.m4a", "recited": "audio/4d6f5ba20fcd627c03b9.m4a", "recitedText": "ٱشْكُرْ"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "اُشْكُرِي", "plain": "اُشْكُرِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/7d477225018df02e45cb.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "اُشْكُرَا", "plain": "اُشْكُرَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/596f01bc26a29f981d01.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "ٱشْكُرُوا۟", "plain": "اُشْكُرُوا", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/159ed7abd4d0b4c34ac3.m4a", "recited": "audio/2aea0eab899b3c195dea.m4a", "recitedText": "وَٱشْكُرُوا۟"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اُشْكُرْنَ", "plain": "اُشْكُرْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/a7ed76f8943dcc1d4c5e.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "56:70", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5049.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "If We willed We verily could make it bitter. Why then, give ye not thanks?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Dileseydik onu tuzlu yapardık. O halde şükretseniz ya!", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ہم چاہیں تو اسے کھاری کردیں پھر کیوں نہیں شکر کرتے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Kalau Kami kehendaki, niscaya Kami jadikan dia asin, maka mengapakah kamu tidak bersyukur?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَشَآءُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَعَلْنَٰهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أُجَاجًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَلَوْلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَشْكُرُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/e326fcca143c707feab6.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) thank", "bs": "zahvaljujete", "tr": "şükrediyorsunuz", "fr": "vous remerciez", "id": "kalian berterima kasih", "ur": "تم سب شکر کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা জানাও", "fa": "سپاس می‌گزارید"}}]}, {"ref": "36:73", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3778.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Benefits and (divers) drinks have they from them. Will they not then give thanks?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlarda daha birçok menfaatleri ve türlü içecekleri de var. Hâlâ şükretmeyecekler mi?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور ان کے لیے ان میں کئی طرح کے نفع اور پینے کی چیزیں ہیں تو کیا شکر نہ کریں گے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan mereka memperoleh padanya manfaat-manfaat dan minuman. Maka mengapakah mereka tidak bersyukur?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَنَٰفِعُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمَشَارِبُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَفَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَشْكُرُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/40aa97cddaa18cccc60c.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "zahvaljuju", "en": "they are grateful", "tr": "şükrederler", "fr": "ils sont reconnaissants", "id": "mereka bersyukur", "ur": "وہ شکر کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা কৃতজ্ঞ হয়", "fa": "سپاس می‌گویند"}}]}, {"ref": "2:152", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/159.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Therefore remember Me, I will remember you. Give thanks to Me, and reject not Me.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O halde beni anın, ben de sizi anayım. Bana şükredin de nankörlük etmeyin.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو میری یاد کرو میں تمہارا چرچا کروں گا اور میرا حق مانو اور میری ناشکری نہ کرو-", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Karena itu, ingatlah kamu kepada-Ku niscaya Aku ingat (pula) kepadamu, dan bersyukurlah kepada-Ku, dan janganlah kamu mengingkari (nikmat)-Ku.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَٱذْكُرُونِىٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَذْكُرْكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱشْكُرُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/2aea0eab899b3c195dea.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i zahvaljujte!", "en": "and be grateful!", "tr": "ve şükredin!", "fr": "et soyez reconnaissants !", "id": "dan bersyukurlah!", "ur": "اور شکر کرو!", "bn": "এবং কৃতজ্ঞ হও!", "fa": "و سپاس بگویید!"}}, {"text": "لِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَكْفُرُونِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "4:147", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/640.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "What concern hath Allah for your punishment if ye are thankful (for His mercies) and believe (in Him)? Allah was ever Responsive, Aware.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Eğer şükreder ve iman ederseniz Allah size azabı ne yapar? Allah, şükredenlerin mükafatını veren ve her şeyi bilendir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اللہ تمہیں عذاب دے کر کیا کرے گا اگر تم حق مانو، اور ایمان لاؤ اور اللہ ہے صلہ دینے والا جاننے والا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mengapa Allah akan menyiksamu, jika kamu bersyukur dan beriman? Dan Allah adalah Maha Mensyukuri lagi Maha Mengetahui.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "مَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَفْعَلُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِعَذَابِكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَكَرْتُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a544b1a679f8bd74e887.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) thanked", "bs": "zahvalili ste", "tr": "şükrettiniz", "fr": "vous avez remercié", "id": "kalian telah berterima kasih", "ur": "تم سب نے شکر کیا", "bn": "তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা জানিয়েছ", "fa": "سپاس گزاردید"}}, {"text": "وَءَامَنتُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَكَانَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَاكِرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلِيمًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "54:35", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4881.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "As grace from Us. Thus We reward him who giveth thanks.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Katımızdan bir nimet olarak. Biz şükredeni böyle mükafatlandırırız.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اپنے پاس کی نعمت فرماکر، ہم یونہی صلہ دیتے ہیں اسے جو شکر کرے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "sebagai nikmat dari Kami. Demikianlah Kami memberi balasan kepada orang-orang yang bersyukur,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "نِّعْمَةً", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عِندِنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَجْزِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَكَرَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/632c2e512e7f26eae524.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "(ko) zahvaljuje", "en": "(who) is grateful", "tr": "(kim) şükrederse", "fr": "(celui qui) est reconnaissant", "id": "(yang) bersyukur", "ur": "(جو) شکر کرے", "bn": "(যে) কৃতজ্ঞ", "fa": "(که) سپاسگزار است"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "تَشْكُرُونَ", "count": 19, "first": "2:52", "audio": "audio/e3a3078bbd58ce313191.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) thank", "bs": "zahvaljujete", "tr": "şükrediyorsunuz", "fr": "vous remerciez", "id": "kalian berterima kasih", "ur": "تم سب شکر کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা জানাও", "fa": "سپاس می‌گزارید"}}, {"arabic": "يَشْكُرُونَ", "count": 9, "first": "2:243", "audio": "audio/40aa97cddaa18cccc60c.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"bs": "zahvaljuju", "en": "they are grateful", "tr": "şükrederler", "fr": "ils sont reconnaissants", "id": "mereka bersyukur", "ur": "وہ شکر کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা কৃতজ্ঞ হয়", "fa": "سپاس می‌گویند"}}, {"arabic": "وَٱشْكُرُوا۟", "co